{"seq":2,"slug":"workspace-protocols","title":"Workspace 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/workspace-protocols","wordCount":1035,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"workspace-协议\">Workspace 协议</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Workspace</strong> 是包管理器对 Monorepo 的原生支持，它围绕三件事运作：包间链接、依赖提升、统一 lockfile。三大包管理器都实现了 Workspace，但对这三件事的处理方式不同，最终体现在&quot;是否会产生幽灵依赖&quot;这一关键差异上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workspace</td>\n<td>在仓库中声明多个包的机制</td>\n<td>决定包的发现与链接方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖提升（Hoisting）</td>\n<td>将子包依赖提升到根 <code>node_modules</code></td>\n<td>减少磁盘占用，但引入访问越权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵依赖（Phantom Dep）</td>\n<td>未声明却被访问到的包</td>\n<td>依赖脆弱，换包管理器即暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:</code> 协议</td>\n<td>声明内部包引用的版本说明符</td>\n<td>发布时自动转换为实际版本号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>依赖提升是幽灵依赖的根源</strong>：pnpm 用虚拟存储 + 符号链接从机制上阻止越权访问，npm 与 yarn classic 的平铺提升则无此防护，yarn PnP 通过取消 <code>node_modules</code> 实现严格解析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workspace-的概念\">Workspace 的概念</h2><p><strong>Workspace</strong>（工作空间）是包管理器提供的原生 Monorepo 支持能力。它允许在一个仓库中定义多个包，包管理器会自动处理这些包之间的依赖链接、依赖提升和安装优化。三大主流包管理器——<strong>pnpm</strong>、<strong>npm</strong> 和 <strong>yarn</strong>——都提供了 Workspace 支持，但实现机制和行为差异显著。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Workspace 机制&#10;        ROOT_PKG[根 package.json&lt;br/&gt;定义 workspace 范围]&#10;        PM[包管理器]&#10;        LINK[符号链接&lt;br/&gt;内部包互相引用]&#10;        HOIST[依赖提升&lt;br/&gt;共享依赖到根目录]&#10;        LOCK[统一 lockfile&lt;br/&gt;确保确定性安装]&#10;&#10;        ROOT_PKG --&gt; PM&#10;        PM --&gt; LINK&#10;        PM --&gt; HOIST&#10;        PM --&gt; LOCK&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Workspace 机制\n        ROOT_PKG[根 package.json&lt;br/&gt;定义 workspace 范围]\n        PM[包管理器]\n        LINK[符号链接&lt;br/&gt;内部包互相引用]\n        HOIST[依赖提升&lt;br/&gt;共享依赖到根目录]\n        LOCK[统一 lockfile&lt;br/&gt;确保确定性安装]\n\n        ROOT_PKG --&gt; PM\n        PM --&gt; LINK\n        PM --&gt; HOIST\n        PM --&gt; LOCK\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-workspace\">pnpm Workspace</h2><p><strong>pnpm</strong> 通过 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 文件定义工作空间，是目前 Monorepo 场景下最推荐的包管理器。它使用<strong>内容寻址存储</strong>（Content-addressable Storage）和<strong>硬链接</strong>（Hard Links）来实现高效的磁盘利用和严格的依赖隔离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;tools/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tools/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;packageManager&quot;: &quot;pnpm@9.15.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;engines&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node&quot;: &quot;&gt;=20.0.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packageManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm@9.15.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"engines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">=20.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pnpm-的依赖存储机制\">pnpm 的依赖存储机制</h3><p>pnpm 不会将依赖平铺到 <code>node_modules</code> 根目录，而是使用<strong>虚拟存储</strong>（Virtual Store）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"node_modules/&#10;├── .pnpm/                          # 虚拟存储&#10;│   ├── react@18.3.1/&#10;│   │   └── node_modules/&#10;│   │       └── react/              # 硬链接到全局 store&#10;│   └── lodash@4.17.21/&#10;│       └── node_modules/&#10;│           └── lodash/&#10;├── react -&gt; .pnpm/react@18.3.1/node_modules/react    # 符号链接&#10;└── @myorg/&#10;    └── ui -&gt; ../../packages/ui                        # workspace 包链接\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .pnpm/                          # 虚拟存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── react@18.3.1/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       └── react/              # 硬链接到全局 store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── lodash@4.17.21/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           └── lodash/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── react -> .pnpm/react@18.3.1/node_modules/react    # 符号链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── @myorg/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── ui -> ../../packages/ui                        # workspace 包链接</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> pnpm 的严格模式默认禁止访问未在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明的依赖，从根源上杜绝了幽灵依赖问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-workspace\">npm Workspace</h2><p>npm 从 v7 开始支持 Workspace，通过 <code>package.json</code> 的 <code>workspaces</code> 字段定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;workspaces&quot;: [&quot;apps/*&quot;, &quot;packages/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"workspaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apps/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>npm Workspace 使用<strong>提升策略</strong>（Hoisting），将所有包的依赖尽可能提升到根目录的 <code>node_modules</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"node_modules/&#10;├── react/                          # 提升到根目录&#10;├── lodash/&#10;├── @myorg/&#10;│   ├── ui -&gt; ../../packages/ui     # workspace 包符号链接&#10;│   └── utils -&gt; ../../packages/utils&#10;└── apps/web/node_modules/&#10;    └── some-conflicting-dep/       # 版本冲突时保留在子目录\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── react/                          # 提升到根目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── lodash/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── @myorg/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui -> ../../packages/ui     # workspace 包符号链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── utils -> ../../packages/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── apps/web/node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── some-conflicting-dep/       # 版本冲突时保留在子目录</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用的 workspace 命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 等效的 npm workspace 命令&#10;// npm run build --workspace=packages/ui&#10;// npm run build -w packages/ui&#10;// npm run build --workspaces  (所有 workspace)&#10;// npm install lodash -w packages/utils\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等效的 npm workspace 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm run build --workspace=packages/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm run build -w packages/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm run build --workspaces  (所有 workspace)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm install lodash -w packages/utils</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"yarn-workspace\">yarn Workspace</h2><p><strong>yarn</strong>（尤其是 yarn v3+ / Berry）的 Workspace 支持也通过 <code>package.json</code> 的 <code>workspaces</code> 字段定义，但其 <strong>Plug&#39;n&#39;Play（PnP）</strong> 模式彻底改变了依赖解析机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;workspaces&quot;: [&quot;apps/*&quot;, &quot;packages/*&quot;],&#10;  &quot;packageManager&quot;: &quot;yarn@4.6.0&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"workspaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apps/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packageManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yarn@4.6.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .yarnrc.yml&#10;nodeLinker: pnp # 或 node-modules&#10;enableGlobalCache: true&#10;nmHoistingLimits: workspaces\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .yarnrc.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nodeLinker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 或 node-modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">enableGlobalCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nmHoistingLimits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">workspaces</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖提升与幽灵依赖\">依赖提升与幽灵依赖</h2><p><strong>依赖提升</strong>（Hoisting）是 npm 和 yarn classic 的默认行为：将子包的依赖&quot;提升&quot;到根目录的 <code>node_modules</code>，减少磁盘占用和安装时间。但这带来了一个严重的副作用——<strong>幽灵依赖</strong>（Phantom Dependencies）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 幽灵依赖问题&#10;        PKG_A[packages/app&lt;br/&gt;依赖: react]&#10;        PKG_B[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;依赖: react, lodash]&#10;        ROOT_NM[根 node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;react, lodash 被提升]&#10;&#10;        PKG_A --&gt;|安装| ROOT_NM&#10;        PKG_B --&gt;|安装| ROOT_NM&#10;        PKG_A -.-&gt;|可以访问 lodash&lt;br/&gt;但未声明依赖!| ROOT_NM&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 幽灵依赖问题\n        PKG_A[packages/app&lt;br/&gt;依赖: react]\n        PKG_B[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;依赖: react, lodash]\n        ROOT_NM[根 node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;react, lodash 被提升]\n\n        PKG_A --&gt;|安装| ROOT_NM\n        PKG_B --&gt;|安装| ROOT_NM\n        PKG_A -.-&gt;|可以访问 lodash&lt;br/&gt;但未声明依赖!| ROOT_NM\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/app/src/index.ts&#10;&#10;// ❌ 幽灵依赖：app 没有声明 lodash 为依赖，但因为提升可以访问&#10;import { merge } from &#39;lodash&#39;;&#10;&#10;// ✅ 正确：app 自己声明了 react 为依赖&#10;import React from &#39;react&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/app/src/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 幽灵依赖：app 没有声明 lodash 为依赖，但因为提升可以访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { merge } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lodash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 正确：app 自己声明了 react 为依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> React </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n<th>提升策略</th>\n<th>幽灵依赖防护</th>\n<th>磁盘效率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pnpm</td>\n<td>虚拟存储 + 符号链接</td>\n<td>✅ 默认严格隔离</td>\n<td>高（硬链接）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm</td>\n<td>平铺提升</td>\n<td>❌ 无防护</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yarn classic</td>\n<td>平铺提升</td>\n<td>❌ 无防护</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>yarn PnP</td>\n<td>无 node_modules</td>\n<td>✅ 严格解析</td>\n<td>高（zip 存储）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三大包管理器对比\">三大包管理器对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>pnpm</th>\n<th>npm</th>\n<th>yarn (Berry)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workspace 定义</td>\n<td><code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code></td>\n<td><code>package.json#workspaces</code></td>\n<td><code>package.json#workspaces</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖隔离</td>\n<td>严格（默认）</td>\n<td>宽松</td>\n<td>PnP 模式下严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>快（PnP 更快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘占用</td>\n<td>低（内容寻址）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（PnP zip）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态兼容</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>PnP 有兼容性问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lockfile</td>\n<td><code>pnpm-lock.yaml</code></td>\n<td><code>package-lock.json</code></td>\n<td><code>yarn.lock</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤命令</td>\n<td><code>--filter</code></td>\n<td><code>-w</code> / <code>--workspace</code></td>\n<td><code>workspace foreach</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区趋势</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>较小但活跃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"workspace-协议版本说明符\">Workspace 协议版本说明符</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中引用内部包时，使用 <code>workspace:</code> 协议前缀：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:^&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/config&quot;: &quot;workspace:~&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:^\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:~\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>说明符</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>发布时转换为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>workspace:*</code></td>\n<td>任意版本</td>\n<td>实际版本号，如 <code>1.2.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:^</code></td>\n<td>兼容版本</td>\n<td><code>^1.2.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:~</code></td>\n<td>近似版本</td>\n<td><code>~1.2.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>workspace:*</code> 在发布时会被自动替换为包的实际版本号，这是 Monorepo 发布流程的关键机制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Workspace 协议))&#10;    pnpm&#10;      pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;      内容寻址存储&#10;      严格隔离&#10;    npm&#10;      package.json workspaces&#10;      依赖提升&#10;      生态兼容最好&#10;    yarn&#10;      PnP 模式&#10;      零安装&#10;      zip 存储&#10;    核心问题&#10;      依赖提升&#10;      幽灵依赖&#10;      workspace: 协议\">mindmap\n  root((Workspace 协议))\n    pnpm\n      pnpm-workspace.yaml\n      内容寻址存储\n      严格隔离\n    npm\n      package.json workspaces\n      依赖提升\n      生态兼容最好\n    yarn\n      PnP 模式\n      零安装\n      zip 存储\n    核心问题\n      依赖提升\n      幽灵依赖\n      workspace: 协议</pre><ul>\n<li>Workspace 是包管理器对 Monorepo 的原生支持，实现包间链接、依赖提升和统一 lockfile</li>\n<li>pnpm 通过内容寻址存储和严格隔离机制，从根源上解决了幽灵依赖问题，是 Monorepo 场景的首选</li>\n<li>npm Workspace 的提升策略简单直接但存在幽灵依赖风险，适合对兼容性要求高的项目</li>\n<li>yarn Berry 的 PnP 模式彻底去除了 node_modules，但可能面临第三方库的兼容性问题</li>\n<li><code>workspace:*</code> 协议是 Monorepo 内部包引用的标准方式，发布时会自动转换为实际版本号</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Workspace 协议","id":"workspace-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspace 的概念","id":"workspace-的概念"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm Workspace","id":"pnpm-workspace"},{"level":3,"text":"pnpm 的依赖存储机制","id":"pnpm-的依赖存储机制"},{"level":2,"text":"npm Workspace","id":"npm-workspace"},{"level":2,"text":"yarn Workspace","id":"yarn-workspace"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖提升与幽灵依赖","id":"依赖提升与幽灵依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"三大包管理器对比","id":"三大包管理器对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspace 协议版本说明符","id":"workspace-协议版本说明符"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monorepo 概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/monorepo-overview"},"next":{"title":"依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/dependency-management"}}